```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Maren Solberg — Editorial & Architectural Photography</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Portfolio of Maren Solberg, freelance editorial, architectural, and documentary photographer based in Copenhagen and Lisbon." />

  <!-- Editorial & Monospace Typography -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300;1,400;1,500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    /* ==========================================================================
       DESIGN TOKENS & THEMING
       ========================================================================== */
    :root {
      --bg: #F6F4EF;
      --bg-elevated: #EFECE5;
      --bg-card: #ECE8DF;
      --text: #151412;
      --text-muted: #666159;
      --text-subtle: #8F897F;
      --border: rgba(21, 20, 18, 0.12);
      --border-strong: rgba(21, 20, 18, 0.28);
      --accent: #8C4A32; /* Warm terracotta / darkroom safelight ochre */
      --accent-soft: rgba(140, 74, 50, 0.1);
      --nav-bg: rgba(246, 244, 239, 0.86);
      --shadow-soft: 0 24px 60px rgba(21, 20, 18, 0.08);
      --film-bg: #161513;
      --film-text: #E6E1D8;

      --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace;

      --container: 1400px;
      --gutter: clamp(1.25rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem);
      --ease-out: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
      --radius-sm: 2px;
      --radius-md: 4px;
    }

    [data-theme="dark"] {
      --bg: #0E0E0D;
      --bg-elevated: #161614;
      --bg-card: #1C1B19;
      --text: #EFECE6;
      --text-muted: #A19B90;
      --text-subtle: #6F6A62;
      --border: rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.12);
      --border-strong: rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.28);
      --accent: #D68A67;
      --accent-soft: rgba(214, 138, 103, 0.14);
      --nav-bg: rgba(14, 14, 13, 0.86);
      --shadow-soft: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      --film-bg: #080807;
      --film-text: #D9D4C9;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       RESET & BASE
       ========================================================================== */
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      font-size: 16px;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      transition: background-color 0.45s var(--ease-out), color 0.45s var(--ease-out);
    }

    /* Subtle analog paper / film grain overlay */
    body::after {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9998;
      opacity: 0.028;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button, input, textarea, select {
      font: inherit;
      color: inherit;
    }

    button {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    ::selection {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: var(--container);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-inline: var(--gutter);
    }

    .mono {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .serif {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .sr-only {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: -1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 0;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       SCROLL REVEAL
       ========================================================================== */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(26px);
      transition: opacity 0.85s var(--ease-out), transform 0.85s var(--ease-out);
    }

    .reveal.is-visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .reveal {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
        transition: none;
      }
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto;
      }
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       CUSTOM GALLERY CURSOR (DESKTOP ONLY)
       ========================================================================== */
    .gallery-cursor {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      z-index: 9000;
      pointer-events: none;
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(21, 20, 18, 0.86);
      color: #F6F4EF;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.35);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.22s ease, transform 0.28s var(--ease-out);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    }

    [data-theme="dark"] .gallery-cursor {
      background: rgba(246, 244, 239, 0.92);
      color: #151412;
    }

    .gallery-cursor.active {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       HEADER / NAVIGATION
       ========================================================================== */
    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: var(--nav-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      transition: background-color 0.4s ease, border-color 0.4s ease;
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 72px;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .brand-clock {
      color: var(--text-subtle);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }

    .live-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      display: inline-block;
      animation: pulse 2.8s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.8); }
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2.1rem;
    }

    .nav-link {
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      position: relative;
      padding: 0.25rem 0;
      transition: color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .nav-link::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      bottom: -2px;
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--text);
      transform: scaleX(0);
      transform-origin: right;
      transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease-out);
    }

    .nav-link:hover,
    .nav-link.active {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .nav-link:hover::after,
    .nav-link.active::after {
      transform: scaleX(1);
      transform-origin: left;
    }

    .header-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .theme-toggle {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: border-color 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, background-color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .theme-toggle:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-strong);
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
    }

    .theme-toggle svg {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
    }

    .btn-inquire-nav {
      padding: 0.5rem 1.05rem;
      background: var(--text);
      color: var(--bg);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-out), opacity 0.25s ease;
    }

    .btn-inquire-nav:hover {
      opacity: 0.88;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .mobile-menu-btn {
      display: none;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    /* Mobile Drawer */
    .mobile-drawer {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 999;
      background: var(--bg);
      padding: 6.5rem var(--gutter) 2.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transform: translateY(-12px);
      transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s var(--ease-out);
    }

    .mobile-drawer.open {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .mobile-drawer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .mobile-drawer-links a {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 8vw, 3.2rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       HERO SECTION
       ========================================================================== */
    .hero {
      padding-top: calc(72px + clamp(2.5rem, 6vh, 4.75rem));
      padding-bottom: clamp(3.5rem, 7vh, 5.5rem);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.02fr) minmax(0, 1.18fr);
      gap: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 4.5rem);
      align-items: end;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 100%;
      gap: 2.25rem;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .hero-eyebrow-line {
      width: 32px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border-strong);
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 5.6vw, 5.4rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.02;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .hero-title em {
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .hero-desc {
      max-width: 44ch;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.72;
    }

    .hero-cta-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;
      background: var(--text);
      color: var(--bg);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-out), opacity 0.25s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-ghost {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text);
      transition: background-color 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover {
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      border-color: var(--text);
    }

    .hero-meta-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .hero-meta-item dt {
      color: var(--text-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .hero-meta-item dd {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* Hero Interactive Showcase Frame */
    .hero-stage {
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-frame {
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
      max-height: 76vh;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .hero-slide {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(1.04);
      transition: opacity 1.1s var(--ease-out), transform 1.6s var(--ease-out);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-slide.active {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1);
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .hero-slide img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .hero-frame-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 0.9rem;
      padding-top: 0.75rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .hero-caption-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }

    .hero-caption-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .hero-caption-exif {
      color: var(--text-subtle);
    }

    .hero-controls {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .hero-nav-btn {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--text);
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .hero-nav-btn:hover {
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      border-color: var(--border-strong);
    }

    .hero-counter {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      min-width: 46px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       SECTION HEADINGS
       ========================================================================== */
    .section {
      padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8.5vw, 7.5rem);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    }

    .section-label {
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
      display: block;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.6rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.06;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       ARCHIVE / SELECTED WORKS GALLERY
       ========================================================================== */
    .gallery-toolbar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .filter-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }

    .filter-btn {
      padding: 0.48rem 0.95rem;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .filter-btn:hover {
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
    }

    .filter-btn.active {
      color: var(--bg);
      background: var(--text);
    }

    .filter-count {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      opacity: 0.65;
      margin-left: 0.25rem;
    }

    .view-switcher {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      padding: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .view-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      padding: 0.38rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .view-btn.active {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    /* Curated Editorial Grid */
    .gallery-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .photo-card {
      grid-column: span 4;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.5s var(--ease-out);
    }

    /* Editorial asymmetric rhythm */
    .gallery-grid[data-view="editorial"] .photo-card.span-wide {
      grid-column: span 7;
    }
    .gallery-grid[data-view="editorial"] .photo-card.span-tall {
      grid-column: span 5;
    }
    .gallery-grid[data-view="editorial"] .photo-card.span-half {
      grid-column: span 6;
    }
    .gallery-grid[data-view="editorial"] .photo-card.offset-down {
      margin-top: clamp(0rem, 4vw, 3.75rem);
    }

    .photo-frame {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    }

    .photo-frame.ratio-portrait { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; }
    .photo-frame.ratio-landscape { aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; }
    .photo-frame.ratio-square { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }
    .photo-frame.ratio-cinematic { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; }

    .photo-frame img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.9s var(--ease-out), filter 0.6s ease;
    }

    .photo-card:hover .photo-frame img {
      transform: scale(1.045);
    }

    .photo-overlay-tag {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0.85rem;
      left: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.28rem 0.6rem;
      background: rgba(18, 17, 15, 0.72);
      color: #F6F4EF;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-radius: 2px;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s var(--ease-out);
    }

    .photo-card:hover .photo-overlay-tag {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .photo-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding-top: 0.85rem;
    }

    .photo-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .photo-sub {
      color: var(--text-subtle);
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .photo-index {
      color: var(--text-subtle);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Contact Sheet View (35mm Darkroom Proof Sheet!) */
    .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] {
      background: var(--film-bg);
      color: var(--film-text);
      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] .photo-card {
      grid-column: span 1 !important;
      margin-top: 0 !important;
      padding: 0.65rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }

    .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] .photo-frame {
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 2 !important;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }

    .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] .photo-meta {
      padding-top: 0.6rem;
    }

    .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] .photo-title {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--film-text);
    }

    .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] .photo-sub,
    .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] .photo-index {
      color: #D68A67;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
    }

    .contact-sheet-header {
      display: none;
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      color: #D68A67;
    }

    .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] .contact-sheet-header {
      display: flex;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       MONOGRAPH / FEATURED SERIES SPOTLIGHT
       ========================================================================== */
    .monograph-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
      gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
      align-items: center;
    }

    .diptych {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      gap: 1.15rem;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .diptych-frame {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: var(--bg-card);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .diptych-frame:first-child {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    }

    .diptych-frame:last-child {
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    }

    .diptych-frame img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.9s var(--ease-out);
    }

    .diptych-frame:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }

    .monograph-content blockquote {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.5vw, 2.15rem);
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.32;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .monograph-content p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      max-width: 52ch;
    }

    .edition-specs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .edition-specs span {
      display: block;
    }

    .edition-specs .spec-val {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       SERVICES / COMMISSIONS
       ========================================================================== */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .service-card {
      background: var(--bg);
      padding: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1.75rem;
      transition: background-color 0.35s ease;
    }

    .service-card:hover {
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
    }

    .service-num {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .service-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.85rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 0.65rem 0 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .service-card p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.68;
    }

    .service-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.45rem;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.84rem;
    }

    .service-list li::before {
      content: "— ";
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       ABOUT & CREDITS INDEX
       ========================================================================== */
    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.82fr) minmax(0, 1.18fr);
      gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5.5rem);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .portrait-wrap {
      position: relative;
    }

    .portrait-frame {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    }

    .portrait-frame img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: contrast(1.03);
    }

    .portrait-caption {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-subtle);
    }

    .about-bio {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.6vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.35;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .about-body {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 60ch;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .credits-columns {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 2.5rem;
      margin-top: 2.75rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .credits-heading {
      color: var(--text-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .credits-list {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .credits-list li {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.62rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .credits-list li span:last-child {
      color: var(--text-subtle);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       INQUIRE / BOOKING SECTION
       ========================================================================== */
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.88fr) minmax(0, 1.12fr);
      gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5.5rem);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .contact-lead {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 44ch;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.72;
    }

    .direct-contact {
      margin-top: 2.25rem;
      padding-top: 1.75rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.35rem;
    }

    .email-copy-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .email-link {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2.05rem);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding-bottom: 0.1rem;
      transition: color 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .email-link:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .copy-btn {
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .copy-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--text);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .representation-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .rep-box p {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    /* Form Styling */
    .inquiry-form {
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    }

    .form-section-label {
      display: block;
      color: var(--text-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .pill-selector {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    .pill-option {
      padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: all 0.22s ease;
    }

    .pill-option:hover {
      border-color: var(--text);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .pill-option.selected {
      background: var(--text);
      border-color: var(--text);
      color: var(--bg);
    }

    .form-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .field {
      margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
    }

    .field label {
      display: block;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    }

    .field input,
    .field textarea,
    .field select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem;
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      transition: border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .field input:focus,
    .field textarea:focus,
    .field select:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft);
    }

    .field textarea {
      min-height: 126px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .form-footer {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .form-note {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-subtle);
    }

    .form-success {
      display: none;
      padding: 2rem 0.5rem;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .form-success.visible {
      display: block;
    }

    .form-success h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
    }

    .form-success p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       LIGHTBOX MODAL
       ========================================================================== */
    .lightbox {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 5000;
      background: rgba(11, 11, 10, 0.96);
      color: #EFECE6;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.35s var(--ease-out);
    }

    .lightbox.open {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .lightbox-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.15rem clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.12);
    }

    .lightbox-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .lb-btn {
      padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.22);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #EFECE6;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .lb-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.12);
      border-color: rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.5);
    }

    .lightbox-stage {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      min-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .lightbox-image-wrap {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .lightbox-image-wrap img {
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 2px;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
      transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-out), opacity 0.25s ease;
      cursor: zoom-in;
    }

    .lightbox-image-wrap img.zoomed {
      transform: scale(1.65);
      cursor: zoom-out;
    }

    .lb-arrow {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(18, 17, 15, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.22);
      color: #EFECE6;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
      z-index: 5;
    }

    .lb-arrow:hover {
      background: rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.16);
    }

    .lb-prev { left: 1.25rem; }
    .lb-next { right: 1.25rem; }

    .lightbox-drawer {
      width: 340px;
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.12);
      padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
      overflow-y: auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 2rem;
      background: rgba(20, 19, 17, 0.92);
      transition: width 0.35s var(--ease-out), padding 0.35s var(--ease-out), opacity 0.25s ease;
    }

    .lightbox-drawer.collapsed {
      width: 0;
      padding-inline: 0;
      opacity: 0;
      border-left: none;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .lb-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.12;
      margin: 0.5rem 0 0.9rem;
    }

    .lb-story {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #B4AEA3;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    .exif-table {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.95rem;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.12);
    }

    .exif-item dt {
      color: #857F75;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    .exif-item dd {
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      color: #EFECE6;
    }

    .lb-print-btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.15rem;
      background: #EFECE6;
      color: #141311;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      text-align: center;
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    }

    .lb-print-btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .lightbox-bottom {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0.85rem clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(239, 236, 230, 0.12);
      color: #9E988E;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       FOOTER
       ========================================================================== */
    .site-footer {
      padding-block: 3.5rem 2.5rem;
    }

    .footer-top {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .footer-wordmark {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .footer-socials {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .footer-socials a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .footer-socials a:hover {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--text-subtle);
    }

    /* Toast Notification */
    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 1.75rem;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
      z-index: 9500;
      background: var(--text);
      color: var(--bg);
      padding: 0.7rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s var(--ease-out);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }

    .toast.show {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS
       ========================================================================== */
    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .monograph-grid,
      .about-grid,
      .contact-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero-frame {
        max-height: 68vh;
      }

      .services-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .lightbox-stage {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .lightbox-drawer {
        position: absolute;
        right: 0;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        max-width: 88vw;
        z-index: 10;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .nav-links,
      .brand-clock,
      .btn-inquire-nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .mobile-menu-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
      }

      .gallery-grid[data-view="editorial"] .photo-card,
      .gallery-grid[data-view="editorial"] .photo-card.span-wide,
      .gallery-grid[data-view="editorial"] .photo-card.span-tall,
      .gallery-grid[data-view="editorial"] .photo-card.span-half {
        grid-column: span 12;
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      .gallery-grid[data-view="contact"] {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .hero-meta-strip,
      .credits-columns,
      .form-row,
      .representation-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .diptych {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .diptych-frame:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .gallery-cursor {
        display: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Custom Cursor for Desktop Gallery Hover -->
  <div class="gallery-cursor" id="galleryCursor" aria-hidden="true">View</div>

  <!-- Toast Feedback -->
  <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <!-- ========================================================================
       HEADER
       ======================================================================== -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="Maren Solberg Home">
        <span class="brand-name">Maren Solberg</span>
        <span class="brand-clock mono" title="Studio Local Time">
          <span class="live-dot"></span>
          <span id="cphClock">CPH --:--</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary Navigation">
        <a href="#archive" class="nav-link">Archive</a>
        <a href="#monograph" class="nav-link">Monograph</a>
        <a href="#commissions" class="nav-link">Commissions</a>
        <a href="#about" class="nav-link">About</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="header-actions">
        <button type="button" class="theme-toggle mono" id="themeToggle" aria-label="Toggle Darkroom Mode">
          <svg id="themeIcon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/>
          </svg>
          <span id="themeLabel">Darkroom</span>
        </button>

        <a href="#inquire" class="btn-inquire-nav">Inquire</a>

        <button type="button" class="mobile-menu-btn" id="mobileMenuBtn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
            <line x1="4" y1="8" x2="20" y2="8"/>
            <line x1="4" y1="16" x2="20" y2="16"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Mobile Navigation Drawer -->
  <div class="mobile-drawer" id="mobileDrawer" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="mobile-drawer-links">
      <a href="#archive" class="mobile-nav-link">Selected Archive</a>
      <a href="#monograph" class="mobile-nav-link">Monograph</a>
      <a href="#commissions" class="mobile-nav-link">Commissions</a>
      <a href="#about" class="mobile-nav-link">About &amp; Clients</a>
      <a href="#inquire" class="mobile-nav-link">Inquire</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mono" style="color: var(--text-subtle);">
      Copenhagen &middot; Lisbon &mdash; Worldwide Assignments
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========================================================================
       HERO
       ======================================================================== -->
  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div>
            <div class="hero-eyebrow mono">
              <span class="hero-eyebrow-line"></span>
              <span>Editorial &middot; Architecture &middot; Documentary</span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="hero-title">
              Quiet light, <em>architectural</em> form, and honest human presence.
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-desc">
              Maren Solberg is an independent photographer working across medium-format analog and digital processes. Dividing time between Copenhagen and Lisbon, she collaborates with architects, publications, and design houses worldwide.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-cta-row">
              <a href="#archive" class="btn-primary">
                <span>Explore Archive</span>
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
              <a href="#inquire" class="btn-ghost">Commission / Print Inquiry</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <dl class="hero-meta-strip">
            <div class="hero-meta-item">
              <dt class="mono">Availability</dt>
              <dd>Booking Autumn / Winter</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-meta-item">
              <dt class="mono">Format</dt>
              <dd>Leica M11 &amp; Hasselblad 500C/M</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-meta-item">
              <dt class="mono">Base</dt>
              <dd>Copenhagen &amp; Lisbon</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-stage">
          <div class="hero-frame" id="heroFrame" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Open current featured photograph in lightbox">
            <!-- Hero slides injected by JS -->
          </div>
          <div class="hero-frame-bar">
            <div class="hero-caption-group">
              <span class="hero-caption-title" id="heroCaptionTitle">Loading plate...</span>
              <span class="hero-caption-exif mono" id="heroCaptionExif">—</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-controls">
              <button type="button" class="hero-nav-btn" id="heroPrev" aria-label="Previous featured photograph">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
